lness in physical, emotional, spiritual, and mental areas of individual and family. Works towards developing a full awareness of the problem, making a plan, and working it out.","links":[],"images":[]},{"type":"h4","text":"Therapies","html":"Therapies","id":""},{"type":"ul","ordered":false,"items":[{"text":"Holistic Therapy","html":"Holistic Therapy","links":[]},{"text":"Evidence-Based Practices","html":"Evidence-Based Practices","links":[]},{"text":"Yoga & Meditation","html":"Yoga &amp; Meditation","links":[]},{"text":"Individual Therapy & Counseling","html":"Individual Therapy &amp; Counseling","links":[]},{"text":"Family Therapy & Counseling","html":"Family Therapy &amp; Counseling","links":[]},{"text":"Group Therapy & Counseling","html":"Group Therapy &amp; Counseling","links":[]},{"text":"Nutritional Counseling","html":"Nutritional Counseling","links":[]},{"text":"Art & Nature Therapy","html":"Art &amp; Nature Therapy","links":[]}]}],"specialty_groups":[{"heading":"Specialties","items":["Substance Abuse Treatmental"],"text":""},{"heading":"Amenities","items":["Substance Abuse Treatmental"],"text":""}],"info_items":[],"faq_heading":"","faqs":[],"hours":{"heading":"","rows":[]},"tags":{"heading":"","items":[]},"sponsor":{"label":"Sponsored Ad","title":"Start Your Journey Now","text":"Are you or a loved one struggling with alcohol or drug addiction? Finding the right addiction treatment centre can make all the difference in achieving long-term recovery. That's why we've done the research for you and compiled a list of the best alcohol and drug addiction centres in Canada. Our list includes top-rated addiction treatment centres that provide evidence-based therapies, personalized treatment plans, and aftercare support services to help clients overcome addiction and maintain a healthy, fulfilling life in recovery. Whether you're looking for residential or outpatient treatment, we've got you covered. For immediate treatment help call: 1-855-885-4747","href":"tel:1-855